# ── AI tooling ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This portfolio was built with an AI pair. The method is recorded on purpose,
# in DESIGN.md, PRODUCT.md and the commit trail. What is ignored below is the
# exhaust, not the method: machine-local paths, session ids, personal
# permission lists, caches, and explorations that were tried and dropped.
# None of it is source, and none of it would mean anything to a reader.

# Claude Code workspace: personal permission allowlist, enabled-plugin list,
# vendored third-party skills, and a 944KB handoff bundle from a design
# direction that was abandoned.
.claude/

# Impeccable: local runtime state.
.taste-skill/
.impeccable/review/
.impeccable/mocks/
.impeccable/build/
.impeccable/hook.cache.json

# Design critiques are working records, like code-review threads. They are
# candid about this site's own unfixed problems and are kept on disk, not shipped.
.impeccable/critique/

# Committed from .impeccable/ on purpose: config.json (detector exceptions, each
# with its written reason), design.json (the token sidecar) and surfaces/ (the
# direction contract). Those are the design system's record, not its scaffolding.
